  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Office of the Vice Minister of Finance for Fiscal Policies and Institutional Reform in Egypt</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project focuses on two components within the domain of public finance in Egypt:&#x2022; Better management of financial risks in government spending and in the management of state-owned enterprises&#x2022; Intelligible and comprehensible publishing of government policy in the field of taxes and government spendingThrough 5 missions to Egypt, the Ministry of Finance of the Netherlands, DG Budget, the National Academy for Finance and Economics has exchanged knowledge with the Ministry of Finance of Egypt on challenges and opportunities related to Fiscal Risks and Data Visualisation and Strategic Budget Documentation.</narrative>
  </description>
